    "biography": {
      "concept": "Circuit Rider pattern-analyst, travelling with Captain Robot's column (Act 2-3)",
      "notes": "Arvind is the Circuit Riders' pattern-analyst, usually found surrounded by disassembled signal gear. He hears patterns and makes a point of knowing the difference between the ones that are there and the ones he likes. He is quiet and careful, and will power down a display rather than feed someone's hunger for an answer. Hand him a story and he asks whether it is coherent or true, and then which."
    }
